  "answer": "I found no earlier ticket asking for `--secret` support, including file sources, in `wslc build`. The searches turned up only unrelated tickets. One was a docs request for wslc (WSL#14498). Others were general container or Docker requests. Treat this as a new feature request. In the ticket, ask for Docker/Podman-compatible `--secret id=<id>,src=<file>` syntax, and for secrets to be mounted only during the build step so they don't end up in image layers. Until it exists, avoid putting secrets in build args or copying them into the image, because they can leak into image history. If you can, run the build with a tool that supports build secrets."
 },
